  "prefLabel": "Mec 401.01 Continuing education course",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mec 401.01 “Continuing education course” means a course based on laws, rules, codes, and standards as approved by the mechanical licensing board for the further education of licensed fuel gas fitters and plumbers in New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #10848, eff 7-1-15; ss by #13771, eff 12-10-23 (formerly Saf-Mec 401.01) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Mec 400)",
